==Skins==
{{Tabber
|Default
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:SwordSkeleton.png|200px]]
|Made entirely of white parts that resemble a skeletal humanoid.

Does not have a full torso, but instead has a partial ribcage.

Head is slightly smaller than most other enemies, and it has two large black eyeholes.

Wields a black sword with skulls that have neon blue eyes to attack enemies.
}}
|Mage
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:MageSwordSkeleton.png|200px]]
|Made out of brown wooden parts.

Has two neon green eyes and a neon green core in its torso.

Wields a wooden sword to attack enemies.
}}
|Fallen
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:FallenSwordSkeleton.png|200px]]
|Made entirely of black parts that resemble a skeletal humanoid.

Has grey shoulders.

Does not have a full torso, but instead has a partial ribcage.

Head is slightly smaller than most other enemies, and it has two large blue eyeholes.

Wields a grey sword with a blue crystal blade to attack enemies.
}}
|Duck
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:DuckSwordSkeleton.png|200px]]
|Small white duck, with an orange beak and feet and black eyes.

Wields two grey blades strapped to both of its wings to attack enemies.
}}
|Creepy Santa
|{{SkinGallery
|[[File:CreepySantaSwordSkeleton.png|200px]]
|White snowman with sticks as arms, black stone eyes and buttons, carrot nose, stitched mouth, ice hair and chain wrapped around its neck.

Wields a candy cane to attack enemies.
}}
}}

